 math-inline\">e^-</code>, <strong>up</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u</code></td>\n<td><strong>Positron</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^+</code>, <strong>down</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>Trefoil is chiral (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,3} \\neq T_{2,3}^{\\sigma}</code>); mirror = antiparticle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3</td>\n<td>cubic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td><strong>Positron</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^+</code>, <strong>down</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d</code></td>\n<td><strong>Electron</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^-</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>Right trefoil; opposite chirality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4</td>\n<td>quartic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1</code></td>\n<td><strong>Higgs</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code> (mass mechanism)</td>\n<td>(self)</td>\n<td>Figure-eight is amphichiral (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H = H^{\\sigma}</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4</td>\n<td>quartic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0+0+0</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{B}_3</code></td>\n<td><strong>Proton</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code>, <strong>neutron</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p^{\\sigma}</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>Borromean link of 3 quarks; linking requires quartic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td>quintic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5_1</code></td>\n<td><strong>Muon</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu^-</code>, <strong>charm</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu^+</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>Cinquefoil; chiral, genus 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td>quintic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5_1^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td><strong>Antimuon</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu^+</code>, <strong>strange</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu^-</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>Mirror cinquefoil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">7</td>\n<td>septic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">7</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7_1</code></td>\n<td><strong>Tau</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau^-</code>, <strong>bottom</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau^+</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>Third-generation torus knot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">8</td>\n<td>octic</td>\n<td align=\"center\">8</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">8_{19}</code></td>\n<td>Hopf<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^2</code> <strong>color binding</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,4}</code> force carrier in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{0,1}</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/jet-planck-steps-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
